👑🧠 Birbal and the Magic Stick (Raw Story)

One day, a merchant came to Emperor Akbar.

He said, “Someone has stolen my money!”

Akbar asked Birbal to find the thief.

Birbal gathered all the suspects and gave each one a stick.

He said, “This is a magic stick. The thief’s stick will grow longer by tomorrow.”

Everyone took their sticks home.

The thief became scared.

He thought, “If my stick grows, I will be caught.”

So he cut his stick shorter during the night.

The next day, everyone returned.

Birbal checked the sticks and found one shorter than the others.

He pointed at the man and said, “You are the thief!”

The man admitted his crime.

💖 Moral:

Truth always comes out in the end.
